  "description": "Bring the sweetest countryside charm to your creative projects with this adorable Cute Watercolor Farm Clipart Bundle 🚜🐄🌻✨\nThis beautifully curated collection features a wide variety of charming farm animals, rustic barnyard elements, harvest produce, cozy farmhouse details, and countryside-inspired illustrations designed in a soft whimsical watercolor style. Perfect for nursery decor, children’s products, planner stickers, seasonal printables, farmhouse branding, classroom resources, scrapbooking, and print-on-demand creations, this bundle combines the warmth of cottagecore, rustic farmhouse aesthetics, and playful barnyard life into one highly versatile collection. From sweet cows, pigs, sheep, chickens, and bunnies to berry baskets, homemade pies, tractors, barns, jam jars, carrots, sunflowers, and harvest signs, these cliparts are ideal for anyone looking to create cozy, heartwarming, and timeless farm-themed designs 🌾🍓🐓\n✨ What’s included:\n– 24 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 24 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 24 SVG files\n🐄 Featured designs include: Cow, Pig, Sheep, Goat, Pony, Duck, Hen, Rooster, Bunny, Farmhouse, Tractor, Pickup truck, Berry basket, Egg basket, etc.\n🎨 Perfect for:\n– Nursery wall art\n– Children’s decor\n– Planner stickers\n– Printable planners\n– Scrapbooking\n– Journaling\n– Baby shower designs\n– Classroom materials\n– Seasonal printables\n– Stickers\n– Mugs & apparel\n– Canva templates\n– Print-on-demand shops\nCreate heartwarming, playful, and irresistibly charming designs with this Cute Farm Watercolor Clipart Collection – perfect for lovers of barnyard animals, harvest season, rustic farmhouse decor, and cozy countryside living 🐄🌻🚜",
